            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Exclusive News!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platypus Reclayed is out NOW! <br> <br>23 years later, original creator Anthony Flack alongside the Claymatic Team has brought back Platypus - Reprogrammed from scratch and updated for modern hardware.. <br> <br>Platypus Reclayed is moulded from the ground up with all-new models and artwork photographed in 4K, featuring updated gameplay, new weapons and additional content. <br> <br>It's available now on PC, Mac and Consoles.</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Fly the famed Platypus fighter through a fantastic landscape of carefully molded clay to protect inhabitants of Mungola from the Collosatropolians! Collect power-ups and bonus stars to give your Platypus the boost you need. Every level of this gorgeous arcade challenge bursts with original fun that's perfect for gamers of all ages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cooperative Multi-Player (1-3 Players Locally)<br></li><li>Two Difficulty Levels<br></li><li>Stunning Claymation Graphics<br></li><li>Unique and Addictive Fun</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Fly the famed Platypus fighter through a fantastic landscape of carefully molded clay to protect inhabitants of Mungola from the Collosatropolians! Collect power-ups and bonus stars to give your Platypus the boost you need. Every level of this gorgeous arcade challenge bursts with original fun that's perfect for gamers of all ages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cooperative Multi-Player (1-3 Players Locally)<br></li><li>Two Difficulty Levels<br></li><li>Stunning Claymation Graphics<br></li><li>Unique and Addictive Fun</li></ul>",
